            "review_title": "Review at TaoLi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Grahame H\nSalavan, Laos177 contributions\n0\nAll You Can Eat Dim-Sum\nAug 2018 • Friends\nThere's an advertisement that asks \"Are these the best Dim-sums in the world? Well they are here! It's a buffet with a difference. Order as many different varieties as you like and bamboo dish by bamboo dish they keep arriving. You don't even have to get out of your seat. There are other accompaniments too. You can keep ordering until you are well and truly satiated. Note:- I don't think they do this buffet all the time, you may need to check on the Hotel Nikko website.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 10, 2018",
